Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.01,0:00:12.01,Default,TIP,0,0,10,,{\fs65}{\fad(200,200)\an8}來源：官方字幕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.01,0:00:15.01,Default,TIP,0,0,10,,{\fs65}{\fad(200,200)\an8}潤色：爪爪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.01,0:00:18.01,Default,TIP,0,0,10,,{\fs65}{\fad(200,200)\an8}壓製：相簿、白、囧冏浻烱、120903
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs65\shad0\bord0\c&H6356AC&\pos(960,637.2)}爪爪字幕組
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.27,0:00:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,有點焦慮啊 胡力歐同學
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.91,0:00:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,才不是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.65,0:00:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你是和歌子硬塞給我們的 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.23,0:00:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是大衛的粉絲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.08,0:00:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 但你說「硬塞」是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.61,0:00:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛的粉絲 是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.45,0:00:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你現在可出名了 也變成大塊頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.09,0:00:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你的槍呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你拿什麼型號
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我用萊剋星頓
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.79,0:00:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,完全不夠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.58,0:00:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你想用那個對付漩渦幫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.09,0:00:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,用這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.19,0:00:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎 是薩達拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.51,0:00:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,太厲害了 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,技術霰彈槍太帥了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.31,0:00:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,這些電擊彈…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.02,0:00:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,咻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.10,0:01:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,咻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.27,0:01:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,咻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.45,0:01:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.57,0:01:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛 住手 別踢我的膝蓋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.40,0:01:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,煩死了 快閉嘴 你是小鬼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.86,0:01:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,跟在我身後 不要往前衝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.99,0:01:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你要我守後面 我可不是新人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.74,0:01:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,大小姐們 注意了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.25,0:01:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,再一分鐘到達目的地
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.63,0:02:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,果然 人還不少
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.09,0:02:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至還有炮塔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.25,0:03:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,人太多了 逐個黑入 我得累死了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.56,0:03:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,正面突入肯定不行 繞後門進去更合理
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.34,0:03:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我更傾向無視「合理」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.40,0:03:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.06,0:03:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我們不找後門嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.73,0:03:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你不如自己去找
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.53,0:03:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 我要跟你們去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.99,0:03:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,看來他們要從前門進去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.07,0:03:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了 混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.45,0:03:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.16,0:03:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你又是哪根蔥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.08,0:03:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,小猴子迷路了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.33,0:03:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,看來他們想挑起什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.19,0:03:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,耳朵被屎堵住了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.84,0:03:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不如讓我在你耳朵上開個洞 看你還聽不聽…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,閉上你的嘴 否則把你殺了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.38,0:03:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,掃描完畢 短路操作進行中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.36,0:03:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,總算趕上了 這群混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.40,0:03:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡 他們有駭客
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.99,0:04:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,這槍林彈雨的…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.24,0:04:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡 人太多 我跟不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.62,0:04:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.96,0:04:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,沒子彈了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.34,0:04:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那個女的沒子彈了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.04,0:04:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,打她
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.17,0:04:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,接下來 大槍槍
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.22,0:04:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,有炮塔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.18,0:04:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,琦薇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.26,0:04:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,小心 有駭客…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.43,0:04:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,臭小子 給我發號施令…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.49,0:04:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,準備跟真正的漩渦幫玩玩嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.70,0:04:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好大
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.82,0:04:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,這傢伙身上全是義體
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.67,0:04:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,看我怎麼收拾你這原裝的混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.73,0:05:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,刺穿你的身體
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.75,0:05:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不如由我給你腦袋上開個洞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.72,0:05:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,太厲害了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.04,0:05:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是新的腿部植入體 不錯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那是最後一個了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.92,0:05:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,後面房間裡還有很多人 救援目標也在那
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.88,0:05:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.68,0:05:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了 後面的房間是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.72,0:05:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 胡力歐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.00,0:05:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,可能有陷阱…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.95,0:06:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,伊莎貝拉摩根在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.95,0:06:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你父親讓我們來救你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你現在安全了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.45,0:06:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(361.2,168)}{\shad0\bord0\fs45\c&H2425A5&\frz358.4\pos(318,152)\frx358\fry4}和歌子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.67,0:06:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,和歌子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.42,0:06:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,已確認伊莎貝拉人身安全
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.22,0:06:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,做得非常好 客戶會滿意的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.14,0:06:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.71,0:06:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是炙手可熱的賽博龐克 果然名不虛傳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.49,0:06:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,關於那個新人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不用覺得抱歉 是他自己想和你搭檔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.86,0:06:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我說了他還沒準備好 果然是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.78,0:06:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,有別的工作 我會再聯繫你的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 多謝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.25,0:06:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(632,950.8)}{\fs60\bord0\c&H08CAF9&}匯款入帳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.47,0:06:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(632,950.8)}{\fs60\bord0\c&H24CBF7&}匯款入帳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.29,0:06:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,多謝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.17,0:07:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,總是麻煩你來幫忙 法爾科
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.51,0:07:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,這錢我賺得輕鬆 不好意思啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.42,0:07:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,值得信賴的好司機 可遇不可求
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.59,0:07:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,現在想和你合作的人有很多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.31,0:07:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你說像胡力歐這樣的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.02,0:07:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我見他第一眼就知道他會搞砸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.19,0:07:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,像你這樣的老手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.38,0:07:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,除非認識曼恩 否則也不會和我這樣的年輕人合作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.32,0:07:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,必須承認 你第一次打來電話時
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.49,0:07:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不想給乳臭未乾的新手當保姆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.37,0:07:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,但是現在 不一樣了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.42,0:07:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你會走得比曼恩還要遠
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.80,0:07:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 說了些倚老賣老的話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.34,0:07:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,還有下一檔子活 再聯絡我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.01,0:07:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,待會見了 大衛 琦薇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.88,0:07:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,待會見
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.14,0:07:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,老實說 我一開始 並不相信你能領導團隊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.52,0:08:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,這都要歸功於我們優秀的網路駭客
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.11,0:08:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我們心知肚明 你該和另一個駭客合作的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.61,0:08:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你問過她了 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.99,0:08:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,以前試過 現在我大概是放棄了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.62,0:08:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,沒想到她是那種內心膽怯的類型
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.62,0:08:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我想不只是曼恩和多莉歐的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.42,0:08:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,現在回想起來 當時在地下室的時候 露西的表現就很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.24,0:08:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.22,0:08:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,沒什麼 那時候的我也不太正常
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.85,0:08:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,對了 最早是你介紹露西 加入團隊的 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.69,0:08:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.85,0:08:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,她和你提起過去的事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.61,0:08:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.36,0:08:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,賽博龐克不都是在躲避某種可恥人生的逃難者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.70,0:08:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,或是抱著遙遠志向 而迷失自我的逐夢者嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.33,0:08:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,回顧過去沒有意義
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,臉色怎麼這麼難看 大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.88,0:09:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,別再和老婆婆擠眉弄眼了 來跟我跳舞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.55,0:09:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,說到過著某種可恥人生的人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.44,0:09:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,最可恥的該是我哥 被個露陰癖賽博瘋子殺掉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.22,0:09:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不管了 你看過大衛的超爛舞步嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.60,0:09:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我先撤了 得去一趟義體醫生那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.23,0:09:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼 又要去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.11,0:09:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,叫大夫賣給你一些跳舞植入吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.11,0:09:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,要很酷的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.30,0:09:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.05,0:09:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,待會見
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.53,0:09:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎麼每次都這麼難約
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.79,0:09:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎麼不換個進攻策略
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.21,0:09:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.29,0:09:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,對害羞宅男應該採取 害羞內向的攻勢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.54,0:09:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,有塊爛鐵片卡在手臂裡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.30,0:09:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,這尺寸本來就不適合你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.39,0:10:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,何況還是兩代以前的老版本
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.56,0:10:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣 我有一些很不錯的軍用義體
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.40,0:10:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不了 這個就很好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.40,0:10:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,話說你怎麼還沒瘋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.19,0:10:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,幫我改進下肌肉義體 有岐路司的最新版嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.20,0:10:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 你已經瘋了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.45,0:10:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.16,0:10:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你這段時間得緩一緩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.75,0:10:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,照這個速度 你的心智無法跟上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.71,0:10:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.12,0:10:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不管植入多少義體 都沒感到不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至比自己的皮還適應
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.51,0:10:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我承認你和義體的相容度非比尋常
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.68,0:10:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,可以說你的身體對義體是天生鈍感
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.18,0:10:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你的義體容納量幾乎到達…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.89,0:10:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你認為自己和別人不一樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.06,0:10:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我比較傾向使用「獨特」一詞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.40,0:10:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你的目標是像亞當重錘還是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.86,0:10:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,亞當什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.11,0:10:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,即便出了名 你也還是個新人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.41,0:10:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,連亞當重錘都沒聽說過
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.25,0:10:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,從第四次公司戰爭開始
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.91,0:11:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他就以活著的「全身義體妖魔」舉世聞名
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.25,0:11:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,到現在還是批次製造時代的傳奇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.88,0:11:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,批次製造的傳奇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.71,0:11:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,凡是反對荒坂的人 一律由他送進墳墓
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.72,0:11:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,聽起來像編造的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.63,0:11:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord0\fs50\c&H2425A5&\frz90\pos(923.2,595.6)}琦薇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.63,0:11:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord0\fs65\c&H2425A5&\pos(1524.8,747.6)}琦薇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.08,0:11:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,琦薇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.14,0:11:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.18,0:11:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,現在能到來生一趟嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.14,0:11:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你們還沒喝夠嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.85,0:11:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,有人想見你一面
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.69,0:11:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.82,0:11:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 琦薇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.86,0:11:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.74,0:11:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,初次見面 馬丁內斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.43,0:11:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我們見過 你到派對找曼恩的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.11,0:11:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎 那讓我再次自我介紹一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.17,0:11:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我是法拉第
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.79,0:11:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,有工作要找我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.22,0:11:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,別著急 讓我請你喝一杯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.59,0:12:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我最近聽說很多你的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.43,0:12:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,為自己不斷積累聲譽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.48,0:12:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,裝著斯安威斯坦不斷升級的新人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.44,0:12:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,現在斯安威斯坦只是我義體的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.15,0:12:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,真是如此 你看起來義體比肉身還多
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.86,0:12:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,過去我有工作 經常找曼恩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.66,0:12:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他在團隊配合方面相當優秀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.60,0:12:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,確實
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.29,0:12:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但有時 他對人的執著使他分心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.21,0:12:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,也降低工作品質
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.21,0:12:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,聽說你對團隊合作也挺有一套
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.05,0:12:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我也一樣 不習慣依賴他人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.88,0:12:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 我希望你能證明 自己和曼恩具有同等級的業務水平
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.93,0:12:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,要考驗我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.06,0:12:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,可以這麼理解
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.39,0:12:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,隨你怎麼考驗 但我不幹便宜活
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.73,0:12:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,便宜活 我也一概不接
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.06,0:13:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,委託人是軍用科技的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.09,0:13:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他們是荒坂的勁敵
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,如你所知 公司工作的酬勞最高
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.68,0:13:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,公司活 你不喜歡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.63,0:13:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我接受
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.71,0:13:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.13,0:13:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,這次工作結束後 我有個任務想交給你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.97,0:13:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,對你來說 應該相當熟悉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.82,0:13:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你是指當時田中手裡的數據
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.45,0:13:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,很不幸 我聽說當時 田中那裡並沒有數據
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.57,0:13:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.42,0:13:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,情報也顯示你成功黑入荒坂的ICE
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.19,0:13:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,而且不是琦薇 是一位候補網路駭客
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.29,0:13:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我們團隊少不了駭客
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.53,0:13:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,果然優秀 不過 我聽說有些變動
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.11,0:13:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 案子結束 他們就離開了團隊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.48,0:13:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,為何 如此優秀的駭客 可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.12,0:13:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他們志不在此
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.28,0:13:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你來勸說 她或許會回來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.28,0:13:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,說得容易…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.01,0:14:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,荒坂知道軍用科技在和他們作對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.51,0:14:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那還用說
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.10,0:14:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是什麼讓軍用如此迫切
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.39,0:14:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你不需要知道 這樣比較簡單順利
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.77,0:14:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,多餘的情報只會帶來麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.77,0:14:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,有任何有用的新情報嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.18,0:14:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,現在還沒有 但是機會總會出現的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.28,0:14:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,到那之前 先證明你配得上我的時間
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.83,0:14:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.51,0:14:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,很晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.37,0:14:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,原本想要早點回來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.59,0:14:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是去了敏亭酒吧嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.65,0:14:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.51,0:14:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,工作遇到問題了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.14,0:14:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚有同伴被幹掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.83,0:14:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.06,0:14:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,和歌子派的新手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.75,0:15:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎 那其他都好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.67,0:15:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,很輕鬆 新手只是粗心大意罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.90,0:15:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是有點像當初的你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.28,0:15:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,少來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.83,0:15:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.70,0:15:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我們要接一個大案子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.08,0:15:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,真刺激
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.71,0:15:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我是說…如果你能加入的話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.25,0:15:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,現在的團隊不需要兩個駭客吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.46,0:15:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我更希望…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.55,0:15:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.01,0:15:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,拜託再等一段時間
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.04,0:15:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.43,0:15:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你今天又潛入了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.38,0:15:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼不買件好的駭客服呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.52,0:15:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,沒必要
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.94,0:15:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我們可以買最新的駭客椅 會比冰池更舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.03,0:15:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝你 我不喜歡穿駭客服
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.74,0:15:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.14,0:15:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.42,0:15:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那個 大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.40,0:16:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.76,0:16:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,這個星空真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.35,0:16:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,夜之城看不到這種景象 是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.68,0:16:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,覺得我能抓一個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.69,0:16:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.63,0:16:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望我們看得到月亮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.44,0:16:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,月亮沒出來 星星才這麼亮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.61,0:16:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,月亮的光芒會蓋過星星
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.57,0:16:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你在學院時 他們沒教你嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我退學了 記得嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.53,0:16:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.54,0:16:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,這是我第一次離開夜之城
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.16,0:16:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.25,0:16:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你在夜之城外頭生活過吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.68,0:16:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,從這裡看夜之城 就像閃爍燈光製成的牢籠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.68,0:16:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,之前的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.06,0:16:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你說過我和你不一樣 還記得嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.77,0:17:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.15,0:17:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.03,0:17:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想聊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.86,0:17:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你想知道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.49,0:17:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是…想更了解你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.33,0:17:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,荒坂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.58,0:17:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,荒坂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.71,0:17:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.96,0:17:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,孩童時期 我是在其他國家的荒坂設施中長大的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.80,0:17:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,包含我在內
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.80,0:17:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,共有13個孩子 透過了網路駭客能力測試
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.43,0:17:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我們都是孤兒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.68,0:17:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,「我們總有一天會成為網路駭客」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.22,0:17:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,「為世界上最強大的公司服務」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.02,0:17:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那個夢想讓我們熬過艱苦的訓練
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.71,0:17:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我們不停地追逐這個
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.08,0:17:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,根本不是出於自願的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.86,0:17:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但是訓練結束後 我們並沒有被分配到公司部門
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.66,0:17:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,反而被帶到黑暗的地下設施
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.80,0:18:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,強迫進行深度潛入
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.08,0:18:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他把我們派到舊網路上去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.57,0:18:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,舊網是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.34,0:18:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,大約半個世紀前就崩塌的舊網域
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.76,0:18:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.68,0:18:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,被史上最厲害的網路駭客
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.29,0:18:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,魔偶的創始人 一舉擊潰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,就是駭客的始祖和傳奇 拉奇·巴特莫斯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,黑下全球78%網路的傳奇通緝犯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.23,0:18:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他的數據崩潰病毒擊垮整個賽博空間
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.44,0:18:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,把網路粉碎成一個個孤立的本地網
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.58,0:18:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,荒坂的目的是挖掘存在於舊網的價值
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.38,0:18:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那些留存在歷史空間中的遺產
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.29,0:18:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,巨量遺失的知識和資訊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.63,0:18:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我們則是被派到舊網打撈數據的士兵
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.17,0:18:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,裡面都是非法惡意軟體和攻擊性AI
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.09,0:18:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,資深的網路駭客能用整個意識潛入
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.26,0:18:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你是指深層潛入
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.76,0:19:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,潛入能讓賽博空間轉化為 可橫跨的實體世界
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.85,0:19:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,可是每當挖到罕見的數據快取時
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.27,0:19:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,就會被蠻橫的AI鎖定攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.90,0:19:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我們中的很多人最終也能沒逃出舊網
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.62,0:19:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我還是繼續執行潛入
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.15,0:19:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,深信每一次都會是最後一次
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.62,0:19:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,很快就只剩下我們幾個了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.67,0:19:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我們終於意識到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.88,0:19:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,強加於我們的那個夢想 根本不值得
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.17,0:19:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我們想「反正都要死 不如拚死一逃」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.34,0:19:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,用那些大人們教給我們的技術 把他們都殺了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.14,0:19:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,逃了出來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.76,0:19:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直跑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.53,0:20:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以聽見同伴在後面哭喊 但我沒有回頭
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.04,0:20:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,回過神來 我發現自己跑出來了 在一片廢墟之中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.73,0:20:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,在那之後 我很怕 在同一個地方停留太久
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.42,0:20:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,所以去過不少城市
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.89,0:20:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,夜之城對於只想銷聲匿跡的人來說 真是個好地方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.06,0:20:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你現在還會有被追殺的感覺嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我想應該沒有了吧 在夜之城過得太安逸了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.81,0:20:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,危機意識降低了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.28,0:20:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那隻手…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.65,0:20:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,沒什麼 過一會就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.07,0:20:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你一點也沒變
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,為了別人的夢想而活
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.83,0:20:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,但這種心情 我能理解
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.59,0:20:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,大概…我現在已經
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.38,0:21:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不那麼為自己而感到害怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.01,0:21:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,現在我更害怕的是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.80,0:21:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,有一天 你會…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.48,0:21:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是 我能復原大部分數據
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.95,0:21:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但是其中一名產品實驗者的數據
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.11,0:21:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,看起來是嚴重損毀了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.74,0:21:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,這份數據目前看來…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.87,0:21:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,蓄意摧毀的可能性很高
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.83,0:21:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,ICE沒有留下任何蹤跡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.37,0:21:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,這種級別的駭客絕非平庸之輩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.88,0:21:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不認為田中有理由刪除數據
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.25,0:21:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是綁架中被損毀了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.18,0:21:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.14,0:21:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我這就開始備份 看看還有什麼數據可以復原
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.22,0:21:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.07,0:22:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H030204&\pos(982.4,718.8)}{\shad0\bord0\fs45}拒絕讀取
Comment: 0,0:22:12.12,0:22:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.02,0:01:36.41,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}Eyes burning a way through me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.60,0:01:42.76,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}Eyes destroying so sweetly
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.99,0:01:49.31,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}Now there is a fire in me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.72,0:01:57.49,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}A fire that burns
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.84,0:02:26.55,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}This fire is out of control
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.55,0:02:27.35,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.35,0:02:28.20,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.20,0:02:29.02,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.02,0:02:30.41,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it down
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.68,0:02:40.48,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.48,0:02:41.33,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.33,0:02:42.15,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.15,0:02:43.54,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it down
Comment: 0,0:02:44.15,0:02:46.15,op-english,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.02,0:01:36.41,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}世人的眼光中我烈焰焚身
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.60,0:01:42.76,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}眼神中期盼著甜蜜殺戮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.99,0:01:49.31,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}現在我的心中燃起了一簇烈火
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.72,0:01:57.49,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}以我殘軀化烈火
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.84,0:02:26.55,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}這簇失控的火焰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.55,0:02:27.35,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}讓我把這座城市燒成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.35,0:02:28.20,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.20,0:02:29.02,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:30.41,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.68,0:02:40.48,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}讓我把這座城市燒成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.48,0:02:41.33,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.33,0:02:42.15,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.15,0:02:43.54,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒成灰
Comment: 0,0:02:36.14,0:02:38.14,op-english,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.85,0:22:49.17,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}They will finally feel the flames
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.17,0:22:53.60,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Flames that run down through my veins
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.60,0:22:57.94,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}I will make the city burn
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.94,0:23:02.30,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}We're not planning to return
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.06,0:23:06.70,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Trying so hard to be free
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.12,0:23:10.52,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}To make you see what I see
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.89,0:23:15.43,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Hold on to your wishes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.43,0:23:19.25,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}If you can't hold on to me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.45,0:23:23.05,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Forgive me for letting you down
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.94,0:23:28.30,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Forgive me for letting you down again
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.30,0:23:31.50,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}I guess I'm not strong enough
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.12,0:23:35.34,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Right now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.16,0:23:42.70,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Oh my love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.70,0:23:47.03,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.03,0:23:54.32,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}love
Comment: 0,0:23:54.88,0:23:56.88,op-english,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.85,0:22:49.17,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}他們終究會擦出愛情之火
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.17,0:22:53.60,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}火化為血液 在我體內流淌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.60,0:22:57.94,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我會引燃這座都市
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.94,0:23:02.30,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我們從未有撤退的打算
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.06,0:23:06.70,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}努力去獲得自由
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.12,0:23:10.52,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}只為讓你見我所見
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.89,0:23:15.43,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}牢牢抓住你的期盼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.43,0:23:19.25,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}如果你無法再握住我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.45,0:23:23.05,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}請原諒我 讓你失望了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.94,0:23:28.30,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}請原諒我 又一次
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.30,0:23:31.50,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我想還未擁有守護你的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.12,0:23:35.34,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}只為此時
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.16,0:23:42.70,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}哦 我的摯愛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.70,0:23:47.03,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我們永恆的愛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.03,0:23:54.32,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}你我永不分離
Comment: 0,0:22:07.83,0:22:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,
